# Fit Core Gym 🏋️

A modern gym landing page designed to introduce a fitness center, highlight its key benefits, showcase member testimonials, and encourage visitors to join through a membership form.

## Overview

Fit Core Gym is a landing page created as part of a Front-End development assignment.

The main goal of the project is to provide visitors with a clear overview of the gym, highlight its advantages, build trust through member testimonials, and encourage users to join through a membership form.

## Features

- Hero section with a strong visual introduction and call-to-action
- "Why Choose Us" section highlighting the gym's key benefits
- "What Our Members Say" section for customer testimonials
- Membership form for collecting user information
- Structured and visually organized landing page
- Image-based visual sections

## Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3

## CSS Techniques

This project focuses on practicing fundamental CSS layout techniques, including:

- Float-based layouts
- `inline-block` for the testimonials section
- Custom styling and positioning
- Section-based page structure
- Image positioning and styling

